      "at": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-yao.txt#1804-2125",
      "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-yao.txt",
      "text": "Mkamulanowu wagopolekwe mchiyawo ni chikamuchisyo chakutyochela ku United Nations Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights pa kumbuchila yaka 50 yamkamulanowu Tukutogolela kwejinji ku chele chiwanjachi nambo soni wandu wosope wiwakamuchisye pa masengo gosope gigakamuchisye kuti mkamulanowu ugopolelekwe mchiyawo."
     }
    ],
