      "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-yao.txt",
      "text": "Chiwanja cha United Nations chilichitamilisye jele mitweji, chayiwendile yilambo yayili mamembala gakwe kuti ijenesye posepose jele mitweji kuti wandu ajimanyilie nikujikamulisya masengo."
     },
     {
      "at": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-yao.txt#1445-1537",
      "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-yao.txt",
      "text": "Paligongo ali, chiwanja cha United nations chilipeleche kugagosa maufulu ga mundu jwalijose."
     }
